sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant API as API (Flask)
  participant PG as Postgres
  participant MG as Mongo (results)

  C->>API: GET /api/v1/export/<task_id>?formato=no_tecnico (JWT)
  API->>PG: Verifica existencia de Result/ResultStatus (opcional)
  API->>MG: find(collection=<task_id>)
  API->>API: Filtra clases problemáticas y confianza >= 80%
  API->>API: Etiqueta confianza (muy probable/probable/quizás con error)
  API-->>C: CSV (Content-Type: text/csv, attachment)

